#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.141.0 — Sysadmin 5: Updates, Changes & the Test
Discipline (pass 5 of 8).

Every change is staged, documented, reversible: the host's update
stream received governed, customisations as owned-forever decisions
under the make-vs-take test, custom fields with their permission
levels, print formats as the firm's outward face, workflows as
authority-in-configuration, and the one change ceremony for
everything. Manual depth from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_sysadmin_pro.seed_sysadmin_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.140.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

